                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill Act delivers for rural America:\n\n\u2705Cuts taxes for farmers & small businesses\n\u2705Protects rural hospitals\n\u2705Supports biosecurity & trade\n\u2705Invests in rural schools & ag programs\n\nFlorida\u2019s farmers feed the nation. Let\u2019s make sure they can keep doing it.",
