                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The \u201cAffordable\u201d Care Act\u2019s results after 10+ years show a system that isn\u2019t working:\n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Premiums up 80%\n\ud83c\udfe5 150+ rural hospitals closed\n\ud83c\udfe0 Even $600k earners get subsidies\n\u274c Half of enrollees filed no claims\n\nDespite this data, Democrats are pushing $350B more to sustain a broken model. The answer isn\u2019t bigger subsidies. We must fix what\u2019s driving costs in the first place.",
